Description: tray launcher for web applications — one page per tray icon
 WebTray keeps your web apps in the system tray: every configured URL gets
 its own icon with the site's favicon. Clicking the icon opens the page in
 a lightweight QtWebEngine window; clicking again hides it.
 .
 Logins survive restarts (persistent QtWebEngine profile), window geometry
 and zoom are remembered per page, and a crashed renderer reloads the page
 automatically.
